OL,3,ACan you take the 'London' out of London
OL,4,AFashion Week?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe curtain might have fallen on London
OL,7,FFashion Week (LFW) - but bosses hope
OL,8,Fthe runway of the future will start to
OL,9,Flook a bit different.
OL,11,FFashion Britain is the British Fashion
OL,12,FCouncil's initiative to open up access
OL,13,Fto talent outside of London - so how do
OL,14,Fyou shift the focus away from the
OL,15,Ftraditional centre of that world?
OL,17,FThe council told BBC Newsbeat it has
OL,18,Fbeen working with LFW on a series of
OL,19,Fpop-up events in England, Wales and
OL,20,FScotland to show this year's event was
OL,21,F"bigger than London".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
