OL,3,ACan you take the 'London' out of London
OL,4,AFashion Week?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland wasn't included as a
OL,7,Flocation for this year's initiative -
OL,8,Fbut will be included next year, the
OL,9,Fcouncil said.
